Phase 1 – Brainstorming & Ideation
FitBuddy – AI-Powered Personalized Fitness Assistant
Template folder: 1. Brainstorming & Ideation
Phase Objective
Identify the problem, target users, proposed AI solution, major features, and expected project outcome before
implementation.

1.1 Problem Identification
• People beginning a fitness routine often need a simple weekly plan instead of disconnected exercise suggestions.
• A fitness assistant should adapt recommendations to basic user information such as age, height, weight, and fitness
goal.
• The solution should provide both workout guidance and practical nutrition suggestions while keeping the interaction
simple.

1.2 Proposed Solution
• FitBuddy is proposed as an AI-assisted web application that collects a user's fitness profile and generates structured
fitness guidance.
• The application combines deterministic starter workouts with Gemini-based generation so that useful output remains
available even when the AI service is not configured or temporarily unavailable.
• User feedback can be used to request a revised plan, creating a basic personalization loop.

1.3 Core Ideas
• Profile-based personalization.
• Seven-day workout generation.
• Nutrition tips and meal ideas.
• Feedback collection and plan revision.
• Local persistence using SQLite.
• Simple browser interface with a FastAPI backend.
• Deployment path for a hosted web service.

1.4 Expected Outcome
• A working prototype that demonstrates how Generative AI can be combined with a web API and local database to
create a personalized fitness assistant.
• A project structure that can later be extended with authentication, progress tracking, richer UI, and production
database infrastructure.
